WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.810
Every RNA medicine begins as a sequence. To design RNA, first understand it.

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:14.310
RiboLoop learned the language of RNA from more than 47 million natural sequences, by filling in the blanks.

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:18.620
From the letters alone, it recovers how a real ribozyme folds.

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:24.800
It is the best at predicting which mutations break an RNA, at a fraction of the size.

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:27.520
Next: designing new RNA,

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:30.860
and personalised mRNA cancer vaccines.

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:32.260
RiboLoop.
